WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.858
One thing I really miss about New York

2
00:00:01.858 --> 00:00:04.409
is the Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade.

3
00:00:04.409 --> 00:00:05.551
That was one of my favorite
(audience cheering)

4
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:07.291
things that happened here.

5
00:00:07.291 --> 00:00:09.124
Every year I would go.

6
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.134
But, I always had one criticism.

7
00:00:12.134 --> 00:00:13.814
Why are the balloons always things for kids,

8
00:00:13.814 --> 00:00:16.507
like Pikachu, Ronald McDonald.

9
00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:20.950
I think, the parade balloons should be New York themed.

10
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:21.783
I really do.

11
00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:22.875
It's a big New York event.

12
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:23.708
(audience cheering)

13
00:00:23.708 --> 00:00:24.983
I believe that, in my heart.

14
00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:28.527
(audience cheering)

15
00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:30.471
That's the thing I'm most passionate about

16
00:00:30.471 --> 00:00:31.563
in this lifetime.

17
00:00:31.563 --> 00:00:33.604
(laughing)

18
00:00:33.604 --> 00:00:36.370
So, I came up with some New York themed balloon designs.

19
00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.470
Can I share 'em with you

20
00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.722
if they work out.
(audience cheering)

21
00:00:40.722 --> 00:00:44.976
Instead of Big Bird, how about this New York staple?

22
00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:46.899
Time Square Elmo, right there, you see?

23
00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:49.899
(audience laughing)

24
00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.067
You smell him before you see him.

25
00:00:54.979 --> 00:00:56.758
Here's another New York balloon I think would be great.

26
00:00:56.758 --> 00:00:58.267
A vandalized Citi Bike,

27
00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.750
I think that would be fantastic.

28
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.083
(laughter and applause)

29
00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.240
Check this one out.

30
00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.680
The New York Giants current 1 - 7 record.

31
00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:11.013
(booing and applauding)

32
00:01:16.354 --> 00:01:18.264
There's a really angry guy in the audience.

33
00:01:18.264 --> 00:01:19.336
(laughing)

34
00:01:19.336 --> 00:01:21.436
He was like, "What are you doin'?"

35
00:01:21.436 --> 00:01:23.686
(laughing)

36
00:01:24.878 --> 00:01:26.734
That guy lost his shit on that joke.

37
00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:27.937
He was like, "What?"

38
00:01:27.937 --> 00:01:30.611
(laughing)

39
00:01:30.611 --> 00:01:32.834
Do I have my facts wrong, sir?

40
00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:34.497
(laughing)

41
00:01:34.497 --> 00:01:36.028
Here's a Macy's themed balloon.

42
00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:38.695
It's a discounted bottle of their Pitbull cologne.

43
00:01:38.695 --> 00:01:39.711
Yeah, that'd be nice.

44
00:01:39.711 --> 00:01:41.961
(laughing)

45
00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:46.645
There's another New York balloon, I'd love this.

46
00:01:46.645 --> 00:01:48.801
It's a pigeon and a cockroach fighting over a cronut.

47
00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:51.051
(laughing)

48
00:01:57.348 --> 00:01:59.944
Hey, now that guy and I are friends again, all right.

49
00:01:59.944 --> 00:02:00.777
(laughing)

50
00:02:00.777 --> 00:02:01.732
He's like, "That's okay."

51
00:02:01.732 --> 00:02:03.249
(laughing)

52
00:02:03.249 --> 00:02:04.890
I also thought, since I'm back in town,

53
00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:07.156
the Thanksgiving Parade would maybe have a Conan balloon.

54
00:02:07.156 --> 00:02:08.622
You know, I just thought maybe.

55
00:02:08.622 --> 00:02:10.872
(cheering)

56
