And, guess what?

64
00:02:27.884 --> 00:02:29.832
My balloon took a week to make.

65
00:02:29.832 --> 00:02:31.224
One week.

66
00:02:31.224 --> 00:02:32.418
It was easy.

67
00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.768
Here's what we did, we really did this,

68
00:02:34.768 --> 00:02:36.984
we went out and we bought one of those New York City

69
