strike rat balloons.

70
00:02:38.449 --> 00:02:39.656
You know what I'm talking about?

71
00:02:39.656 --> 00:02:41.906
(laughing)

72
00:02:43.198 --> 00:02:44.961
You can buy those.

73
00:02:44.961 --> 00:02:46.452
Anyone can buy those.

74
00:02:46.452 --> 00:02:47.389
(laughing)

75
00:02:47.389 --> 00:02:50.253
I bought one and we just added Conan features to it.

76
00:02:50.253 --> 00:02:51.329
(laughing)

77
00:02:51.329 --> 00:02:54.537
